      "text": "What LedgerPilot does\nLedgerPilot reconciles bank feeds against invoices for plumbing, electrical and HVAC businesses. It categorises transactions, flags unmatched invoices, and pushes a reviewed ledger into QuickBooks Online and Xero every night.\nThe workflow\nLedgerPilot works inside the monthly bookkeeping close that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
